---
description: agent-kit rules for this repository (always applied)
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` first (single entry point), then the session state file it names.

This tool has no agent-kit hooks, so do their duties by hand: `docs/agents/standard/NO-HOOKS.md`.

Always:
- Present a plan and wait for the owner's explicit "yes" before the first edit, commit, migration, deploy or config change.
- Ask before push to the default branch, force-push, deploy, real builds/releases, publishing, destructive SQL/infra, or printing a secret.
- Compile every owner message into a private brief (goal, repo context, acceptance, constraints, mode); show only goal + acceptance.
- Replies: ≤ 15 short lines, result first, in the owner's language. Evidence states: PASS / FAIL / BLOCKED / NOT RUN / N/A.
- Update the handoff before the context fills; offer a continuation prompt when the owner says limits are near.
- Never write secrets or the owner's form of address into files, commits or PRs.
